214	/// Shown while `statusStream` has no data yet. Blank for the happy path
215	/// (RNF01: no loading UI below 300ms), but surfaces a centered spinner once
216	/// the wait crosses that threshold — `auth-refresh` is retried by
217	/// `RetryInterceptor` on `NETWORK_TIMEOUT`/`NETWORK_OFFLINE`, so a slow or
218	/// offline boot could otherwise leave the screen looking frozen for several
219	/// seconds with zero feedback. Kept as a private, inline, one-off widget
220	/// (no new shared-widget param) — same minimal-treatment convention Story
221	/// 1.3's submit button uses for its own >300ms affordance.
222	class _BootLoadingScreen extends StatefulWidget {
223	  const _BootLoadingScreen();
